#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43c246806c12da523e1cfe2e92f92e4a9e163445d83f1f8ba83d73d747d232ca
#. default-sha256: 3b6048e389cffce494d7f3a210ead3904f1377a705d1b0dea55a74c66ce349b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs persévérait dans l’écriture "
"de ses lettres mais cela n’arrangeait rien—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫ au contraire, cela attisait les flammes du "
"malentendu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f6a66ceae2a70a1a465f39d029188e5b8543230c2001a24aaa7b8fad1939f7c
#. default-sha256: c42774a3bc856107806ea6345671144b4c6637a4e21d9ddc2f3230736f75875e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce manège continua encore pendant plusieurs mois. ⟪k:1⟫Au-dehors, le soleil avait beau "
"répandre une douce chaleur printanière, les vents froids et cinglants de l’hiver persistaient à "
"souffler sans relâche entre Jacopo et sa femme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c253e1b6a0349c3d8de0434e504909c51823eccf2658b9199957fd262f02d78f
#. default-sha256: dc5d9071cb17fafd4934bfe99c0f2ce5bace5b86d1a88499b26618b9e4c17126
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs ne pouvait quitter la remise et ne recevait jamais de "
"réponse à ses lettres, son unique source d’information était Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ead45b214e3763236b6c3b1210507d4aefd3ee4ba3cf147b1a24a585b069b945
#. default-sha256: c3c295618e7012c3c1ab6766aae67f7d4e3a160b4cab16aeb4eb6a4c0212021c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Semaine après semaine, les circonstances restaient les mêmes, mais quelque chose d’autre "
"semblait montrer des signes de changement :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b593e2c777d316fd6891e397dac0d60448485f4f095a34627a7c5c9cd274fd6
