msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫son état mental."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 641b093fe59ba7a3fb4cdf52e0457e643df63e1db75776a35b92a2badb6af646
#. default-sha256: 9bd56ceda5272fb97f1789ce39dbcb9d50611f2650fc8ded88130a06565f9f05
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ça ne sert à rien, madame.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Vous ne faites "
"que perdre votre temps, à ce tarif-là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 781b9e2cdbb4bd354b0249236260b5a64559396d413428d203a167d4a1deef22
#. default-sha256: c3cd4b73530a69f8e25cd5393fb12dbebada1a965367f829075d5ffb07dff3ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je l’ai vu jeter vos lettres au feu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9960def0c74de8961b389d08b603a5d565d59ffbecdf5f491602878943bef6af
#. default-sha256: 943722eeb51503e41c7ec88df630666183ea0269e2d4899bc1560cc941846582
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne va rien lire de ce que vous écrivez,⟪k:1⟫...même si vous y mettez tout votre cœur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f55906dae416e7be3cfe4c822ac9a8fc6e004b2886506a7df864343138a70849
#. default-sha256: ab4722b3558701bc29347d70dfe5eef12cfb9032bf598907a20112c5877de128
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il s’intéresse plus à l’argent et au travail qu’à l’amour.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Voilà quel genre d’homme "
"c’est."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5b7f935f198134d4f4ce2e44938798ded19d7dedbda52b3a5e948cf1e2e2694
