msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As long as I keep writing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tant que je continue à écrire..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf52892a43d23d87dfb192199af3c19db3c02360a724841b8bbab8157038342c
#. default-sha256: a9e921dc858bca08795e79c3f77eb3be0591f7710da960b5ba4d0154d65b8b7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫eventually... ⟪k:1⟫I will get through to him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I cannot stop... ⟪k:4⟫I cannot."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...bientôt... ⟪k:1⟫je réussirai à l’atteindre.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Donc, je ne peux pas arrêter... ⟪k:4⟫"
"je ne peux pas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8005bed6d5a93b66dc7e8bdf9900468e4009c1af992c5c96b05e732392f0d0b
#. default-sha256: 7cd43547b467530e8f00838bbdc385b543c228b2c75510d37674943ca65ee346
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have any idea what he says about you, Madam?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Est-ce que vous avez la moindre idée de la manière dont il parle de vous, madame ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
